 VOF v2 Features - Full List                                                                                                      
                                                                                                                                  
 Running on port 14005                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                  
 ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────                                                 
                                                                                                                                  
 V2 AI Features                                                                                                                   
                                                                                                                                  
 ### 1. AI Script Generator                                                                                                       
                                                                                                                                  
 Endpoint: /api/ai/script                                                                                                         
 Generates voiceover scripts using AI (MiniMax or fallback templates).                                                            
                                                                                                                                  
 | Flag | Type | Description | Default |                                                                                          
 |------|------|-------------|--- ------|                                                                                         
 | topic | string | Topic to generate script about | (required) |                                                                 
 | style | string | Script style: informative, funny, dramatic, viral | informative |                                             
 | duration | int | Target duration in seconds | 30 |                                                                             
                                                                                                                                  
 Example:                                                                                                                         
                                                                                                                                  
 ```json                                                                                                                          
   {"topic": "morning routine", "style": "viral", "duration": 30}                                                                 
 ```                                                                                                                              
                                                                                                                                  
 ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────                                                 
                                                                                                                                  
 ### 2. Auto-Caption Styling                                                                                                      
                                                                                                                                  
 Endpoint: /api/ai/caption-style                                                                                                  
 AI suggests caption styles based on video mood (template, color, size).                                                          
                                                                                                                                  
 | Flag | Type | Description | Default |                                                                                          
 |------|------|-------------|--- ------|                                                                                         
 | video | string | Path to video file | (required) |                                                                             
                                                                                                                                  
 Returns: template, color, size, style                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                  
 ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────                                                 
                                                                                                                                  
 ### 3. Audio Ducking                                                                                                             
                                                                                                                                  
 Endpoint: /api/video/duck                                                                                                        
 Lowers background music volume when voiceover is present.                                                                        
                                                                                                                                  
 | Flag | Type | Description | Default |                                                                                          
 |------|------|-------------|--- ------|                                                                                         
 | video | string | Video with voiceover | (required) |                                                                           
 | music | string | Background music file | (required) |                                                                          
 | duck_level | float | How much to reduce music (0.0-1.0) | 0.3 |                                                                
                                                                                                                                  
 ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────                                                 
                                                                                                                                  
 ### 4. Auto-Split Voice                                                                                                          
                                                                                                                                  
 Endpoint: /api/video/split-voice                                                                                                 
 Splits long scripts into chunks (ElevenLabs 2500 char limit) and merges audio.                                                   
                                                                                                                                  
 | Flag | Type | Description | Default |                                                                                          
 |------|------|-------------|--- ------|                                                                                         
 | script | string | Long script to split | (required) |                                                                          
 | voice | string | Voice ID (adam, chris, sarah, etc.) | adam |                                                                  
 | max_length | int | Max characters per chunk | 2500 |                                                                           
                                                                                                                                  
 ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────                                                 
                                                                                                                                  
 ### 5. Viral Hook Generator                                                                                                      
                                                                                                                                  
 Endpoint: /api/ai/hook                                                                                                           
 Generates attention-grabbing opening hooks.                                                                                      
                                                                                                                                  
 | Flag | Type | Description | Default |                                                                                          
 |------|------|-------------|--- ------|                                                                                         
 | topic | string | Topic for the hook | (required) |                                                                             
 | type | string | Hook type: question, bold-claim, story, shock, list | random |                                                 
                                                                                                                                  
 ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────                                                 
                                                                                                                                  
 ### 6. Trending Sounds                                                                                                           
                                                                                                                                  
 Endpoint: /api/trending/sounds                                                                                                   
 Lists trending background music options.                                                                                         
                                                                                                                                  
 | Flag | Type | Description | Default |                                                                                          
 |------|------|-------------|--- ------|                                                                                         
 | platform | string | Platform: tiktok, instagram, youtube | tiktok |                                                            
                                                                                                                                  
 ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────                                                 
                                                                                                                                  
 ### 7. Aspect Ratio Auto-Crop                                                                                                    
                                                                                                                                  
 Endpoint: /api/video/crop                                                                                                        
 Auto-crops video to target aspect ratio.                                                                                         
                                                                                                                                  
 | Flag | Type | Description | Default |                                                                                          
 |------|------|-------------|--- ------|                                                                                         
 | video | string | Input video path | (required) |                                                                               
 | aspect | string | Target ratio: 9:16, 1:1, 16:9, 4:5 | 9:16 |                                                                  
                                                                                                                                  
